<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Legal &amp; General lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Legal &amp; General lowered.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legal &amp; General Plc was lowered to a &quot;strong hold&quot; from &quot;add&quot; at SBC Warburg, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The move came in a review of the sector in which Warburg analysts reiterated a positive stance towards Refuge Group Plc and United Friendly Plc, sources said.</p>
<p>Refuge shareholders are due to meet next week to approve the merger of the two groups.</p>
<p>Analysts at Warburg were not immediately available for comment. Legal &amp; General shares were up 1/2p at 830-1/2 by 0933 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
